WEBVTT

00:02:57.882 --> 00:03:01.427
and the way to do it
is to rethink and reimagine

00:03:01.427 --> 00:03:02.929
in these three ways.

00:03:03.596 --> 00:03:05.389
We have to rethink time ...

00:03:06.682 --> 00:03:07.808
place ...

00:03:08.184 --> 00:03:09.352
and how we teach.

00:03:10.561 --> 00:03:12.230
So the first is time.

00:03:12.230 --> 00:03:14.941
Time goes hand in hand with cost,

00:03:15.858 --> 00:03:17.652
and this is how it typically goes.

00:03:18.819 --> 00:03:20.446
College courses and degrees

00:03:20.488 --> 00:03:23.574
are typically assessed
based on credit hours.

00:03:23.866 --> 00:03:27.078
And each credit costs money.

00:03:28.371 --> 00:03:30.581
So therefore, in this scenario,